   OPERATING - SLIP ROLLERS

            CAUTION: THE ROLLERS OF THIS MACHINE PRESENT A PINCHING HAZARD.
            MAKE SURE NO BODY PART OR CLOTHING IS NEAR THE ROLLERS DURING
